    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever played real golf? It's nothing like most golf games. You don't just tap a few buttons  and then hit a perfect 250 yard drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real golf, you miss. You slice. You swear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge is the most accurate simulation of the amateur golfer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and detailed club swing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult and  surreal challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Video mixed with 3D courses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge was built almost entirely by me, Luke Muscat. Back in the Old Times I was creator of Jetpack Joyride and Fruit Ninja. A couple of years ago I decided I wanted to try the ultimate game dev challenge and make a game completely solo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by some weird combination of Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy, Trickshot Simulator, and Jetpack Joyride. Yeah, I know. I'm also  documenting the development process on YouTube if you want to see how the sausage is made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is a work in progress and may change in the future. Stay tuned!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever played real golf? It's nothing like most golf games. You don't just tap a few buttons  and then hit a perfect 250 yard drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real golf, you miss. You slice. You swear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge is the most accurate simulation of the amateur golfer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and detailed club swing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult and  surreal challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Video mixed with 3D courses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge was built almost entirely by me, Luke Muscat. Back in the Old Times I was creator of Jetpack Joyride and Fruit Ninja. A couple of years ago I decided I wanted to try the ultimate game dev challenge and make a game completely solo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by some weird combination of Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy, Trickshot Simulator, and Jetpack Joyride. Yeah, I know. I'm also  documenting the development process on YouTube if you want to see how the sausage is made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is a work in progress and may change in the future. Stay tuned!</i></p>",
